<title>NETHERLANDS: Vendex Food takes over Milo, Antre stores.</title>
<headline>Vendex Food takes over Milo, Antre stores.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vendex Food Groep B.V., a unit of Vendex International NV, said on Thursday it had reached agreement to acquire the Milo and Antre convenience store formulas and was taking over the Antoine Petit store concept from sister-company Abilis.</p>
<p>&quot;Through these takeovers, the turnover of Vendex Food Group will increase by around 110 million guilders,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
